1
00:00:08,070 --> 00:00:11,991
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">FROM ME TO YOU</font>

2
00:01:01,082 --> 00:01:06,003
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}KURUMI</font>

3
00:01:10,049 --> 00:01:13,886
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Um, by rumors, are you talking about the
ones that were going around about the two</font>

4
00:01:13,969 --> 00:01:16,889
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- of you?
- Uh huh, those were some of them.</font>

5
00:01:16,972 --> 00:01:19,892
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And does that include the one about how
I was the person who spread the rumors?</font>

6
00:01:19,975 --> 00:01:22,686
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yep, that too. -What about
people saying I'm a gang leader?</font>

7
00:01:22,770 --> 00:01:25,856
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Gang leader?</font>

8
00:01:25,940 --> 00:01:30,194
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">A-According to what people were saying, I
had both of you acting as my backup... -...and</font>

9
00:01:30,277 --> 00:01:32,780
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">was supposedly using
Kazehaya to my advantage. -Huh?</font>

10
00:01:32,863 --> 00:01:35,449
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Really?</font>

11
00:01:35,533 --> 00:01:39,954
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Whoa!</font>

12
00:01:41,330 --> 00:01:44,750
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's honestly hilarious! What a huge
upgrade from you being a cursed ghost!</font>

13
00:01:44,834 --> 00:01:48,254
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Can you imagine it?
Little gangster Sawako!</font>

14
00:01:48,337 --> 00:01:51,841
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So annoying... These
girls get on my nerves!</font>

15
00:01:51,924 --> 00:01:55,594
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hang on... I feel like this doesn't make
much sense. If Kurumi was the one who</font>

16
00:01:55,678 --> 00:01:59,348
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">spread all the rumors about me...</font>

17
00:02:01,934 --> 00:02:06,605
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh... for her to say I went through the
trouble of making you two my backup... but</font>

18
00:02:06,689 --> 00:02:10,484
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">then also badmouthed you...
...doesn't that seem a bit contradictory?</font>

19
00:02:10,568 --> 00:02:14,405
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She obviously didn't think it through
beforehand. And if that's the case... then</font>

20
00:02:14,488 --> 00:02:17,658
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">it means that she's a complete idiot!</font>

21
00:02:17,741 --> 00:02:20,411
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What? Oh no, please don't
say things like that about her...</font>

22
00:02:20,494 --> 00:02:23,205
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She's doing so many horrible things that
she can't keep it all straight anymore.</font>

23
00:02:23,289 --> 00:02:25,833
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sure sounds like an idiot to me!</font>

24
00:02:25,916 --> 00:02:28,460
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You keep saying "idiot this" and "idiot
that", but I don't even remember what</font>

25
00:02:28,544 --> 00:02:31,338
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- we're talking about anymore!
- I'm just saying that she's obviously--</font>

26
00:02:31,422 --> 00:02:34,258
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Stop calling me an idiot!</font>

27
00:02:35,092 --> 00:02:38,429
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's not even my fault! After all, I'm
not the only one who was spreading the</font>

28
00:02:38,512 --> 00:02:41,849
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">rumors, you know. The whole gang leader
thing was made up by the Kazehaya fanclub</font>

29
00:02:41,932 --> 00:02:45,186
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">and it caught on so fast that it
just blended in with everything else!</font>

30
00:02:45,269 --> 00:02:49,481
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If it wasn't for that getting in the
way, then my plan would've been completely</font>

31
00:02:49,565 --> 00:02:53,819
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- foolproof!
- Wait... What?! That isn't... uh true, is it?</font>

32
00:02:56,864 --> 00:03:03,078
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Um... well... even though what you just said
seems to have caused a misunderstanding.</font>

33
00:03:03,162 --> 00:03:07,082
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Maybe um you can try to
clear things up for us.</font>

34
00:03:07,166 --> 00:03:09,251
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I think there's been a mistake
because I know you'd never--</font>

35
00:03:09,335 --> 00:03:11,420
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Mistake?</font>

36
00:03:16,634 --> 00:03:17,968
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">There's no mistake.</font>

37
00:03:20,137 --> 00:03:24,058
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I didn't care if I had to tell lies. The
bad rumors about those two and the one</font>

38
00:03:24,141 --> 00:03:28,020
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">saying you were the
person who started them...</font>

39
00:03:28,103 --> 00:03:30,105
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">...They were all spread by me.</font>

40
00:03:31,565 --> 00:03:35,527
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- So, it was true then?
- Wait, she admitted it?!</font>

41
00:03:35,611 --> 00:03:39,031
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh-huh. And if you were paying
attention, you would've noticed she did</font>

42
00:03:39,114 --> 00:03:42,576
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- that earlier.
- But... But why?</font>

43
00:03:44,036 --> 00:03:45,454
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You were in the way.</font>

44
00:03:49,917 --> 00:03:52,294
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And to be honest, you still are.</font>

45
00:03:54,838 --> 00:04:00,010
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">My goal was to ruin the relationship
you had with Chizu and everyone else.</font>

46
00:04:01,136 --> 00:04:04,515
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Then this whole time... Kurumi, did you...</font>

47
00:04:09,186 --> 00:04:10,396
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">...Actually hate me?</font>

48
00:04:11,563 --> 00:04:15,192
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's right. You really just noticed?</font>

49
00:04:18,028 --> 00:04:21,448
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah, we're friends, right?</font>

50
00:04:22,533 --> 00:04:23,742
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I thought we were...</font>

51
00:04:24,910 --> 00:04:28,831
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Despite what I said, I've
never considered us friends.</font>

52
00:04:38,465 --> 00:04:41,844
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Scumbag!
- See? This is the kind of person she is!</font>

53
00:04:41,927 --> 00:04:45,306
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Tell her how you feel, Sawako!
- Get her!</font>

54
00:04:55,566 --> 00:04:58,652
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">A-Are you okay?!</font>

55
00:04:58,736 --> 00:05:02,323
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh, hey! Say something! Anything!</font>

56
00:05:05,409 --> 00:05:08,996
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I can't take it anymore! This is driving
me nuts! Ugh, that's it! I'm gonna say</font>

57
00:05:09,079 --> 00:05:12,666
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">what's on my mind right
now! Is that okay, Yano-chin?</font>

58
00:05:14,084 --> 00:05:15,002
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kurumi!</font>

59
00:05:16,045 --> 00:05:19,381
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">This whole thing pisses me off, but what's
done is done, so I'll let it go. I don't</font>

60
00:05:19,465 --> 00:05:22,801
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">even want an apology from you.</font>

61
00:05:23,761 --> 00:05:27,264
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Now... say what you will about me.</font>

62
00:05:27,348 --> 00:05:31,852
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But don't you ever talk like you know
Yano-chin and Sawako again, you got that?</font>

63
00:05:31,935 --> 00:05:36,482
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And this better be the last time
you make Sawako cry like this!</font>

64
00:05:37,775 --> 00:05:41,904
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hopefully that's the end of the
rumors problem., That's better</font>

65
00:05:41,987 --> 00:05:46,158
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">: Wow... I've never seen you like this
before. I wish I could be as bold as you,</font>

66
00:05:46,241 --> 00:05:49,578
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Chizu.
- Yoshida...</font>

67
00:05:49,661 --> 00:05:52,956
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Also! Don't take
advantage of other people anymore!</font>

68
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:56,293
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ugh! It's annoying! There! I
finally got that all off my chest</font>

69
00:05:56,377 --> 00:05:59,713
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh, so much for you looking cool.</font>

70
00:06:02,966 --> 00:06:03,801
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That figures...</font>

71
00:06:07,388 --> 00:06:10,099
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako. That's so unfair.</font>

72
00:06:10,641 --> 00:06:11,558
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh?</font>

73
00:06:12,684 --> 00:06:16,772
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Well what's so wrong with taking advantage
of people? I've had plenty of people use</font>

74
00:06:16,855 --> 00:06:20,901
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">me and once they get everything
they need, they toss me aside.</font>

75
00:06:20,984 --> 00:06:25,114
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So why can't I treat
someone else the same way?</font>

76
00:06:25,197 --> 00:06:29,076
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You've really got some
nerve, you know that?</font>

77
00:06:29,159 --> 00:06:34,373
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Basically, you're saying you're not
gonna change the way you do things?</font>

78
00:06:34,456 --> 00:06:37,584
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I mean, why would I bother changing
when there's really nothing in it for me?</font>

79
00:06:37,668 --> 00:06:40,796
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hmm... so that's how you feel.</font>

80
00:06:42,131 --> 00:06:46,468
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You should probably know I'm not as
generous as Chizu is. That said... you don't</font>

81
00:06:46,552 --> 00:06:50,931
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">care even if Kazehaya
finds out about this?</font>

82
00:06:52,891 --> 00:06:54,435
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Maybe I should go and
let him know right away.</font>

83
00:06:54,518 --> 00:06:56,103
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Seriously?</font>

84
00:06:56,645 --> 00:06:58,856
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Yano, please wait--
- Go ahead, tell him!</font>

85
00:07:00,315 --> 00:07:02,359
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What do I care? Just do it!</font>

86
00:07:05,237 --> 00:07:07,531
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">All right, then. If you insist.</font>

87
00:07:09,199 --> 00:07:12,536
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Chizu, it's time for volleyball.
- Oh, that's right.</font>

88
00:07:12,619 --> 00:07:15,956
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Come on, Sawako, just
leave her there. Let's go.</font>

89
00:07:22,212 --> 00:07:23,881
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Why're you still here?</font>

90
00:07:25,215 --> 00:07:29,136
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Shouldn't you follow them
so you can all snitch on me?</font>

91
00:07:31,346 --> 00:07:35,559
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Once you do, you'll have all
of Kazehaya's sympathy again.</font>

92
00:08:15,432 --> 00:08:17,684
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Wait... Ch-Chizu! Ayane!</font>

93
00:08:20,312 --> 00:08:25,234
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Wow, she used my first name, huh?
- She did use first names earlier, y'know?</font>

94
00:08:35,077 --> 00:08:37,037
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Please don't let him know.</font>

95
00:08:38,288 --> 00:08:39,623
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Go ahead, tell him!</font>

96
00:08:40,958 --> 00:08:44,962
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm not really sure why she would say
those things, but there's no way those are</font>

97
00:08:45,045 --> 00:08:49,049
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- her true feelings.
- What do I care? Just do it!</font>

98
00:08:50,384 --> 00:08:53,762
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I know for a fact that
isn't how she feels.</font>

99
00:08:55,806 --> 00:09:01,061
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Please don't say anything
he doesn't need to know.</font>

100
00:09:01,144 --> 00:09:05,816
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Well, to be honest, I don't actually
care if he finds out about it or not.</font>

101
00:09:05,899 --> 00:09:10,571
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If you don't want me to say
anything, that's fine, but... you're sure?</font>

102
00:09:12,030 --> 00:09:12,948
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I know...</font>

103
00:09:15,325 --> 00:09:18,662
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">...because there's no way you'd ever want
the person you like to think badly of you.</font>

104
00:09:18,745 --> 00:09:22,124
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Uh... hey, Sawako.</font>

105
00:09:23,917 --> 00:09:27,087
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I feel like I should probably say... sorry.</font>

106
00:09:28,422 --> 00:09:32,134
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I didn't think you'd be so shocked by me
saying that. Although... it makes sense so I</font>

107
00:09:32,217 --> 00:09:35,887
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">should have expected it.</font>

108
00:09:35,971 --> 00:09:41,685
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- I, uh... shouldn't have gone mother bear.
- What do you mean by "mother bear"?</font>

109
00:09:42,477 --> 00:09:46,607
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ayane... Seems like she was
really worried about me.</font>

110
00:09:48,567 --> 00:09:52,362
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I... I should also be
apologizing here--I'm so sorry!</font>

111
00:09:53,071 --> 00:09:56,199
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Please forgive me for getting
you both involved in all this!</font>

112
00:09:56,283 --> 00:09:59,411
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Whoa! Sawako, we don't actually give a
crap about what all the rumors were saying</font>

113
00:09:59,494 --> 00:10:01,747
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">about us!</font>

114
00:10:01,830 --> 00:10:04,124
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">We were more concerned about what was
being said about you and if you were okay</font>

115
00:10:04,207 --> 00:10:07,294
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- with it.
- If I'm being honest,</font>

116
00:10:07,377 --> 00:10:11,131
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- I'm pretty used to it, so...
- Oh, I see.</font>

117
00:10:13,091 --> 00:10:16,595
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Besides... when it comes to those rumors,
not everything that came from them was</font>

118
00:10:16,678 --> 00:10:20,223
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">bad.</font>

119
00:10:30,817 --> 00:10:33,278
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I made friends 'cause of them.</font>

120
00:10:52,214 --> 00:10:56,843
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Chizu and Ayane... I know that
they'll always be there for me...</font>

121
00:11:01,973 --> 00:11:04,768
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">That's why I can voice my feelings.</font>

122
00:11:15,070 --> 00:11:18,990
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But then there's Kurumi
and I... Where do we stand?</font>

123
00:11:23,328 --> 00:11:26,748
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Damn it, we lost!!
- Not surprising considering we were</font>

124
00:11:26,832 --> 00:11:30,252
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">playing against members of the actual
volleyball team.</font>

125
00:11:30,335 --> 00:11:33,755
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Don't be sad, Chizu...</font>

126
00:11:34,923 --> 00:11:37,592
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I wonder where Kurumi is. I'm worried.</font>

127
00:11:38,135 --> 00:11:42,806
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Same here. She didn't even make it
to the game, so I hope she's okay.</font>

128
00:11:42,889 --> 00:11:46,184
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Well, maybe the reason we even won
today was because she wasn't around.</font>

129
00:11:46,268 --> 00:11:49,563
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">We got Mariko to sub for her
and she's actually athletic.</font>

130
00:11:49,646 --> 00:11:52,607
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Forget being athletic,
Kurumi wasn't even motivated.</font>

131
00:11:52,691 --> 00:11:55,694
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's like, the very least you
could do is tie up all that hair first!</font>

132
00:11:55,777 --> 00:11:58,196
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Seriously!
- Seriously!</font>

133
00:11:58,280 --> 00:12:00,699
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Right?</font>

134
00:12:03,660 --> 00:12:08,123
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh no... Did she not come
back after what happened?</font>

135
00:12:21,970 --> 00:12:23,305
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She's too energetic...</font>

136
00:12:29,978 --> 00:12:32,481
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Sawako Kuronuma, that's your name?</font>

137
00:12:33,148 --> 00:12:36,151
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I mean my name is Sadako...</font>

138
00:12:36,234 --> 00:12:37,235
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You're Sawako!</font>

139
00:12:40,906 --> 00:12:43,492
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- It's perfectly fine...
- You've got this, Chizu! Just keep it up!</font>

140
00:12:43,575 --> 00:12:46,203
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Get 'em!</font>

141
00:12:47,746 --> 00:12:50,957
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kurumi, she... called me by my real name.</font>

142
00:12:52,834 --> 00:12:55,420
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She even called me her friend.</font>

143
00:12:57,047 --> 00:13:01,176
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Despite what I said, I've
never considered us friends.</font>

144
00:13:01,259 --> 00:13:05,013
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Regardless... she referred to me as her
friend that one time, and it was her who</font>

145
00:13:05,096 --> 00:13:08,892
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">talked to me first.</font>

146
00:13:10,644 --> 00:13:14,439
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}It may have been a lie...
but it made me happy.</font>

147
00:13:17,317 --> 00:13:22,447
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I've never really opened up to anyone
about my feelings like this before.</font>

148
00:13:26,701 --> 00:13:27,828
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Was that...</font>

149
00:13:31,581 --> 00:13:33,667
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">...A lie... or the truth?</font>

150
00:13:45,095 --> 00:13:48,473
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Thanks so much for a good match!</font>

151
00:13:49,391 --> 00:13:54,312
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Hey, Sadako! Wasn't that a blast?
- I... had something I</font>

152
00:13:54,396 --> 00:13:59,317
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">needed to say to Kurumi.</font>

153
00:14:00,694 --> 00:14:01,987
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What? Why?</font>

154
00:14:02,070 --> 00:14:03,864
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- Huh?
- I'll be back, okay?</font>

155
00:14:04,781 --> 00:14:11,496
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, right. She didn't really say
anything back there, so it makes sense.</font>

156
00:14:11,580 --> 00:14:18,336
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Come to think of it, it was only
us who said what we wanted, huh? Hm...</font>

157
00:14:18,420 --> 00:14:21,298
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I haven't known her for very long...</font>

158
00:14:21,923 --> 00:14:26,219
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And there are plenty of
things I don't know about her...</font>

159
00:14:26,303 --> 00:14:30,557
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But... she did share her
inner most feelings with me.</font>

160
00:14:32,726 --> 00:14:38,398
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So in return, I think it's only fair...
if I go ahead and tell her mine too.</font>

161
00:14:39,232 --> 00:14:44,404
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">My most precious feelings.
Something I've never told anyone before.</font>

162
00:14:49,534 --> 00:14:51,703
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh? Is the girls
soccer game over already?</font>

163
00:14:51,786 --> 00:14:54,456
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's Kazehaya.</font>

164
00:14:54,539 --> 00:14:57,250
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- You're only showing up just now?
- Ugh, jeez! It's only</font>

165
00:14:57,334 --> 00:15:00,253
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">because Pin gave me so much to do!</font>

166
00:15:00,337 --> 00:15:03,381
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh? Oh right, you're on
the field day committee.</font>

167
00:15:03,465 --> 00:15:06,551
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's so hard being a lady-killer.</font>

168
00:15:08,929 --> 00:15:12,307
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- What're you looking at?
- Hey, you think I should</font>

169
00:15:12,390 --> 00:15:15,727
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">even bother commenting on this?</font>

170
00:15:15,810 --> 00:15:17,062
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Which part of it?</font>

171
00:15:17,145 --> 00:15:20,440
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Don't tell me you
girls, too? Sorry, but no.</font>

172
00:15:20,523 --> 00:15:21,441
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh?!</font>

173
00:15:22,776 --> 00:15:23,944
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Where's Kuronuma?</font>

174
00:15:24,027 --> 00:15:26,321
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She said she was
gonna go look for Kurumi.</font>

175
00:15:26,404 --> 00:15:28,239
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hm? Why? What's up?</font>

176
00:15:28,323 --> 00:15:30,158
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Oh, you mean "that" girl.</font>

177
00:15:32,243 --> 00:15:36,373
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- What do you mean "that girl"?
- It's exactly what it sounds like.</font>

178
00:15:36,456 --> 00:15:39,960
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Being a stud really is a curse sometimes.</font>

179
00:15:42,671 --> 00:15:48,009
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What a shame. She must be out
there, crying her eyes out somewhere...</font>

180
00:15:48,635 --> 00:15:49,552
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">{\an8}- Huh?
- Huh?</font>

181
00:15:50,929 --> 00:15:53,306
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">While she's thinking of... me.</font>

182
00:15:58,436 --> 00:16:02,899
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Ah, could it be that I've
broken yet another innocent heart?</font>

183
00:16:03,525 --> 00:16:07,362
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Hey, you two better not fall for me like
that other girl did. You'd just be wasting</font>

184
00:16:07,445 --> 00:16:10,156
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">your time. 'Cause I'm
only interested in adults!</font>

185
00:16:10,240 --> 00:16:12,993
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Pin! Cut it out, would
ya? Keep it to yourself!</font>

186
00:16:13,076 --> 00:16:15,912
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Huh? What are you even talking about?</font>

187
00:16:15,996 --> 00:16:18,790
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I mean, it's not like I've told everyone
yet! What do you take me for? I'm a true</font>

188
00:16:18,873 --> 00:16:21,710
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">- gentleman!
- You hear that?</font>

189
00:16:21,793 --> 00:16:24,796
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's hard to believe...</font>

190
00:16:24,879 --> 00:16:28,925
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I think this is the first time I've
ever felt bad for the little troublemaker.</font>

191
00:16:29,009 --> 00:16:33,054
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Yeah... even I
sympathize with her on this one.</font>

192
00:16:55,535 --> 00:17:00,081
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I knew it. You've been
here since our talk earlier.</font>

193
00:17:01,666 --> 00:17:04,169
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">What? Did you come to laugh at me?</font>

194
00:17:04,794 --> 00:17:08,381
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Was there another complaint you forgot?
Just spit it out then. Or is it that</font>

195
00:17:08,465 --> 00:17:12,093
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">you've come to pity me.</font>

196
00:17:14,804 --> 00:17:17,515
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I wanted to tell you I like Kazehaya.</font>

197
00:17:19,809 --> 00:17:22,312
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">My feelings for him keep growing, so...</font>

198
00:17:22,395 --> 00:17:25,607
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I guess I should say I love him.</font>

199
00:17:30,570 --> 00:17:35,033
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Actually, that was what I came
to tell you in the first place.</font>

200
00:17:35,575 --> 00:17:39,621
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's something I've been
really wanting to share with you.</font>

201
00:17:41,164 --> 00:17:44,667
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I've never said it out loud before.</font>

202
00:17:47,337 --> 00:17:53,301
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I didn't know saying that to a
friend was gonna be this nerve-wracking.</font>

203
00:17:54,385 --> 00:17:57,263
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">My... heart's going a mile a minute...</font>

204
00:17:58,098 --> 00:18:01,768
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But the fact that it's pounding makes me
realize that I really do like Kazehaya.</font>

205
00:18:01,851 --> 00:18:05,522
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's undeniable.</font>

206
00:18:06,523 --> 00:18:10,485
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm assuming this is how you felt
when you shared your feelings with me.</font>

207
00:18:10,568 --> 00:18:14,572
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I said I'm not your friend.</font>

208
00:18:15,824 --> 00:18:18,576
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Remember? I don't want you
thinking our feelings are the sa--</font>

209
00:18:18,660 --> 00:18:21,454
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I wanna know if you were nervous.</font>

210
00:18:22,122 --> 00:18:25,333
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Maybe even a little embarrassed?</font>

211
00:18:27,085 --> 00:18:30,046
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Were you overjoyed about it?</font>

212
00:18:34,175 --> 00:18:39,305
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Like when you said it out loud or
when you realized you liked him?</font>

213
00:18:39,389 --> 00:18:43,351
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">"Overjoyed?" Why would I feel like that
after telling you? Get real... I told you</font>

214
00:18:43,434 --> 00:18:47,438
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">you're in my way!</font>

215
00:18:49,065 --> 00:18:55,446
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'll never forgive you for daring to
be around Kazehaya without earning it!</font>

216
00:18:56,030 --> 00:18:59,826
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I had assumed with you,
I'd have no trouble winning.</font>

217
00:19:01,035 --> 00:19:06,207
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Because nothing you do could
ever compare, since I... I've always...</font>

218
00:19:08,168 --> 00:19:13,131
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's true, she suits him so much
more than someone like me does.</font>

219
00:19:14,465 --> 00:19:17,886
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'll always... always like Kazehaya.</font>

220
00:19:20,805 --> 00:19:22,265
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">And I'm sure of that.</font>

221
00:19:23,892 --> 00:19:25,351
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">She likes him...</font>

222
00:19:27,353 --> 00:19:32,942
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's obvious. she really, really
likes Kazehaya, with all of her heart.</font>

223
00:19:36,070 --> 00:19:40,366
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Kurumi, I hope that this doesn't sound
weird or anything but compared to when I</font>

224
00:19:40,450 --> 00:19:44,746
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">first met you, I truly think
you're much cuter now than you were.</font>

225
00:19:44,829 --> 00:19:49,083
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I know I'm cute~ that's not the point!</font>

226
00:19:49,667 --> 00:19:53,504
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">But but what good is being cute?</font>

227
00:19:54,214 --> 00:19:58,051
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If Kazehaya doesn't like
me back, it doesn't matter!</font>

228
00:19:58,718 --> 00:20:01,763
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It just hurts...</font>

229
00:20:01,846 --> 00:20:06,100
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">...Because I know he doesn't feel the same
way about me as I do about him. Since</font>

230
00:20:06,184 --> 00:20:10,813
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I've... always watched
over him, I can tell.</font>

231
00:20:10,897 --> 00:20:16,527
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Why did you come back here anyway? I
can't believe I'm crying... with you</font>

232
00:20:16,611 --> 00:20:22,242
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">standing right in front of me like this.</font>

233
00:20:23,993 --> 00:20:26,537
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I'm here because you know
Kazehaya's good sides. You said it</font>

234
00:20:26,621 --> 00:20:29,165
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">yourself.</font>

235
00:20:31,125 --> 00:20:36,589
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">So I thought, that you and I could
talk about them since we both like him.</font>

236
00:20:43,179 --> 00:20:46,349
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">I hate you... so much...</font>

237
00:20:54,107 --> 00:20:57,527
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">If I think about it,
the reason I envied her...</font>

238
00:20:58,361 --> 00:21:02,490
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">...Wasn't just because of something like the
way she looks or her aura, or because she</font>

239
00:21:02,573 --> 00:21:06,953
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">suits him better than me.</font>

240
00:21:07,036 --> 00:21:10,623
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">It's more likely that I thought the way
she was in love with Kazehaya, made her</font>

241
00:21:10,707 --> 00:21:14,335
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">extremely cute.</font>

242
00:22:27,075 --> 00:22:31,496
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">You saw me for exactly who I
am... and still do, even now.</font>

243
00:22:32,497 --> 00:22:34,248
<font face="sans-serif" size="71">Next time: "Rival"</font>
